{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:28708dafce02f45b","name":"Brigand Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-28708dafce02f45b","title":"Brigand Talent Tree","revision":16384,"timestamp":"2024-08-18T00:56:48Z","sha256":"f4d55c8ca6ec23e7a13911d159592e69b1de2c178be55f290ef5001835bb856a","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=16384","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Brigand%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-28708dafce02f45b","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy at War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_at_War"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You use your experience operating on the wrong side of the law to give you an advantage in a fight, fair or otherwise.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Cheap Trick"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Deception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deception","referenceId":"reference:17455029fb9994a3"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When you make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Deception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deception","referenceId":"reference:17455029fb9994a3"}," check to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Feint"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Feint","referenceId":"reference:82a1660a47a16b62"}," against an enemy within 6 squares of you, you can roll twice, keeping the better of the two results.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Easy Prey"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Cheap Trick"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When you make an attack as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"}," and successfully hit an enemy, you can choose to reduce the damage you deal by half. That target is then denied its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"}," bonus to its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," against your attacks until the end of your next turn.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Quick Strike"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Cheap Trick"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["During the initial round of combat, if you successfully damage an enemy who has not yet acted in the combat, you can make an immediate attack as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Free Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Free_Action"}," against a different target within 6 squares of the first target.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Sly Combatant"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Cheap Trick"]},", ",{"tag":"b","children":["Easy Prey"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You quickly move about the battlefield, taking advantage of the chaos of battle. You can use each of the following actions once per encounter as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},":\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Distracting Injury:"]}," Make a single ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"}," against any enemy within your range. If the attack successfully hits, that enemy takes a -2 penalty to his or her attack rolls and damage rolls until the end of the encounter."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Make Them Bleed:"]}," Make a single ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"}," against any living creature within your range. If you successfully deal damage as a result of the attack, that enemy gains a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persistent Condition"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persistent_Condition"}," that can be removed only with a successful DC 25 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Treat Injury"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Treat_Injury","referenceId":"reference:f1b9875c2302ce61"}," check to perform ",{"tag":"a","children":["Surgery"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Surgery"},"."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Strength in Numbers:"]}," Make a single ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"}," against an enemy who is adjacent to one or more of your allies. If you successfully hit that enemy, you gain a +2 bonus to damage for each ally that is adjacent to the target."]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
